OL,3,AThousands demand end to violence in
OL,4,AMexican cartel hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than three million people live in
OL,7,FSinaloa and many say that the war
OL,8,Fbetween the two rival factions - known
OL,9,Fas Los Chapitos and La Mayiza - has
OL,10,Fblighted their lives.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
